    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21548" root="شبث" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ شَبِثٌ</span></b>  <i>A man whose nature it is to cling,
catch, cleave,</i> or <i>adhere, to a thing.</i> (S, K.) And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِرْسٌ ضَبِثٌ شَبِثٌ</span> [<i>A tooth,</i> or <i>molar tooth,</i>] <i>that
catches,</i> or <i>fastens, to a thing.</i> (TA.)

